### Folder API Tests
### Base URL and tokens
@baseUrl=http://localhost:8000
@json=application/json
@token=YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN_HERE
@publicToken=YOUR_PUBLIC_LINK_TOKEN_HERE
@folderId=1

### ============================================
### FOLDER PREVIEW API
### ============================================

### 1. Preview folder (authenticated user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/{{folderId}}/preview
Accept: {{json}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Preview folder via public link token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/{{folderId}}/preview?token={{publicToken}}
Accept: {{json}}

### 3. Preview folder - Unauthenticated (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/{{folderId}}/preview
Accept: {{json}}

### 4. Preview folder - Not found (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/999999/preview
Accept: {{json}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================
### FOLDER DOWNLOAD (ZIP) API
### ============================================

### 5. Download folder as ZIP (authenticated user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/{{folderId}}/download
Accept: application/zip
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Download folder via public link token (requires download permission)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/{{folderId}}/download?token={{publicToken}}
Accept: application/zip

### 7. Download folder - Unauthenticated (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/{{folderId}}/download
Accept: application/zip

### 8. Download folder - Forbidden (view-only permission, expect 403)
# Use a public link token with only 'view' permission
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/{{folderId}}/download?token=VIEW_ONLY_TOKEN
Accept: application/zip


### ============================================
### FOLDER CONTENTS API (existing)
### ============================================

### 9. Get folder contents (authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/{{folderId}}/contents
Accept: {{json}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Get folder contents via public link
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/{{folderId}}/contents?token={{publicToken}}
Accept: {{json}}
